// @system @ref LLP 0292 — framework-owned host
// input capabilities. The slides build proved any non-tap-driven app ends up
// hand-rolling a document key listener (wrapped in batch/allowStateWrites,
// with no disposal channel) and a viewport probe (window.innerHeight at
// mount, no reactivity). These capabilities are the paved path: per-root
// instantiation, owner-tracked disposal, action calls wrapped exactly like
// the runtime's own `every()`.

